{'symbol': 'POOL', 'date': '2022-07-28 16:05:00', 'title': 'POOL CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'COVINGTON, LA., JULY 28, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- POOL CORPORATION (NASDAQ/GSM:POOL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.00 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON AUGUST\xa025, 2022, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON AUGUST\xa011, 2022.'}